"""gmtsar_sharedir — Python port of csh gmtsar_sharedir.csh (PLAN Phase 1).

Print the GMTSAR shared data directory ($GMTSAR/share/gmtsar). One-liner;
exists so Python code can resolve the share dir without shelling out to csh.

Usage:  gmtsar_sharedir
Output: path on stdout

This is a SCAFFOLD — not implemented.
Reference: gmtsar/csh/gmtsar_sharedir.csh (4 lines).

Implementation notes:
- The legacy csh has the path hardcoded by the autoconf build:
  `echo "/home/staff/dliu/gmtsar/share/gmtsar"`
- Python version should resolve it dynamically from $GMTSAR env var
  ($GMTSAR/share/gmtsar), or fall back to a configured constant.
